    "sbc_source": "SEC XBRL us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation (cash-flow add-back), FY2025 10-K: $73M. Corroborated by EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationTaxBenefitFromCompensationExpense of $9M. SBC fell from $1,568M (FY2022) to $220M (FY2023), $24M (FY2024) and $73M (FY2025); the tax-benefit series falls in step, so this is a real change in how UPS pays people (more incentive pay in cash, plus forfeitures reversed), not a tagging gap. No separate equity-award withholding line is tagged.",
